        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/d6d6ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-06-20T04:18:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One thing I noted is that even with Takedown in play, the Chairman’s Operative was still able to pull out underbosses. Would Mistbound, which directly references the deck, stop the Operative?</p>",
