        "created_at": "2016-06-20T04:24:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would not. &nbsp;Any text that says put into play will always bypass not being able to play cards. &nbsp; &nbsp;An example of wording you can compare is Atlantean Font of Power which Mistbound would prevent that card play versus Slamara in Enclave of the Endlings which Mistbound would not prevent. &nbsp;</p>",
