      {
        "id": 177888,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-06-20T12:06:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Against the Dreamer you don't want her to stop playing cards on her flipped side or you can't win. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Use the same team but GrandPa Legacy instead of regular, then have GrandPa Gung-Ho Omnitron-X so they can get Take down in play and play/trash a single card from The Dreamer's deck in a round. Should be easy to take out a single Projection each round.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:01:57.597Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
