        "created_at": "2016-06-20T12:14:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That makes for a long game especially if you ended up at five heroes if you play it out. &nbsp; Though thinking about it setting up a team which shuts down the villain deck every round is going to make for a long game as it means your damage output it likely low. &nbsp;</p>",
